"description":"So much time on our phones disappears without us even noticing. A quick check turns into scrolling, distraction, and mental noise that follows us through the day. Flocus is designed to help you take that time back with more intention and healthier boundaries.\n\nWhether you want to focus deeply, protect your evenings, study without distractions, or simply stop opening the same apps on autopilot, Flocus helps you build healthier habits around the digital routines that drain your attention.\n\nWith Flocus, you can start a Focus Session anytime you need to be present, set up Recurring Sessions that run automatically on the days and times you choose, or use Friction to make impulsive app opens less automatic. You can also create reusable groups of apps and websites for different parts of your life, so your routines feel easier to maintain.\n\nFlocus is flexible enough for real life. Some days you may want stronger protection and a fully blocked session. Other days, a lighter touch is enough. Timed breaks, allow lists, and adjustable focus controls help you find a rhythm that supports your day.\n\nUse Flocus to:\n• reduce mindless scrolling\n• protect work, study, sleep, and personal time\n• block distracting apps and websites\n• allow only selected apps and websites during a session\n• build routines that repeat automatically\n• track your progress with Insights\n\nFlocus Plus unlocks stronger protection and more advanced focus controls for people who want a stricter setup and more support staying on track.\n\nFlocus uses Apple’s Screen Time framework to power blocking features. Screen Time access is required for sessions and restrictions to work.\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://flocus.app/privacy", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":0, "sellerUrl":"https://flocus.app", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "RU"], "fileSizeBytes":"26912768", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCur